{
  "rule_version": "impulse-2.1.0",
  "spec": "docs/impulsos-v2.md",
  "vote_cases_konkorde_line": "edge",
  "notes": [
    "2.1.0 (round 2): these 14 cases are the model='vote' REGRESSION block (spec §R2.i); they keep the round-1 zero line edge = marron - media, declared in vote_cases_konkorde_line. Sequential goldens S01-S11: tests/test_impulse_sequential.py.",
    "Each trigger array is CLOSED candles, oldest -> newest; the LAST element is the candle under evaluation.",
    "Columns are engine inputs as-is (the engine does not recompute indicators from OHLC in these goldens).",
    "edge = konkorde_marron - konkorde_media. Konkorde is ignored on low_tf profiles (scalper, snipper).",
    "position_state.bars_held counts closed trigger bars since entry (entry bar = 0) at the evaluated candle.",
    "expected.stop_price / exit_price are exact (tolerance 1e-6) when present; confidence_min is a lower bound, confidence_max an upper bound when present."
  ],
